# GlycoShield Pipeline Metadata File
# ===================================
# This file contains metadata required for pipeline execution.
# Place this file as "metadata.txt" in your input folder alongside your model subdirectories.
#
# Format: KEY=VALUE (no spaces around =)
# Lines starting with # are comments and will be ignored.

# Required Fields
# ---------------

# User identifier (typically your username)
USER_ID=your_username

# Email address for notifications
EMAIL=your.email@example.com

# Job name (descriptive name for this analysis)
JOB_NAME=my_analysis_job

# Optional Fields
# ---------------
# You can add additional metadata fields here as needed for future enhancements.
# Example:
# DESCRIPTION=Spike protein glycosylation analysis
# PROTEIN_TYPE=viral_glycoprotein
# SUBMISSION_DATE=2024-11-29
